    "whyItMatters": "Privacy, confidentiality, and privilege protect related interests but answer different questions. HIPAA, FERPA, and 42 CFR Part 2 add legal frameworks that may or may not apply to a particular record. Many poor answers rely on the word `confidential` without identifying which protection, person, record, or setting is involved.",
